Package: antigravity-cli
Version: 1.1.14-1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6 (>= 12)
Recommends: alacritty | kitty | gnome-terminal | konsole | xfce4-terminal | xterm
Suggests: alacritty
Installed-Size: 197
Maintainer: sandikodev <androxoss@hotmail.com>
Homepage: https://antigravity.google
Description: Google Antigravity CLI - AI agent platform
 Antigravity is Google's AI agent platform. This package provides the
 command-line interface (agy) for interacting with Antigravity agents.
 .
 Features:
  - Interactive AI agent sessions
  - Multi-turn conversations
  - Tool permission management
  - Workspace integration
  - Model selection and configuration
 .
 Install the desktop launcher for application menu integration:
  sudo apt install antigravity-cli-launcher
